Package: statnnet
Title: Regression-Style Statistical Summaries for Neural Networks Fitted with 'nnet'
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Andrew", "McInerney", , "andrew.mcinerney@ul.ie", role = c("aut",
    "cre", "cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2348-2159")),
    person("Kevin", "Burke", , "kevin.burke@ul.ie", role = "aut")
  )
Author: Andrew McInerney [aut, cre, cph] (<https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2348-2159>),
    Kevin Burke [aut]
Maintainer: Andrew McInerney <andrew.mcinerney@ul.ie>
Description: Adds regression-style statistical summaries to small,
    single-hidden-layer neural networks fitted with 'nnet'. The package
    validates the fitted model, reconstructs its objective and curvature,
    estimates a penalised sandwich covariance matrix, provides individual and
    grouped Wald-type diagnostics, and computes partial covariate effects with
    uncertainty. It retains the original fit and does not fit or select neural
    networks. Methods follow McInerney and Burke (2023)
    <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2311.08139>.
